ISO-10303-21;
/* Tfa005: TWO ADVANCED_FACEs with single-belt wires on periodic surfaces: face[0] on SPHERICAL_SURFACE with 8-edge equatorial belt wire passing through the sphere's pole vertex — no degenerate edge at pole; face[1] on CONICAL_SURFACE with 8-edge outer wire whose endpoint is the cone apex vertex — no degenerate edge at apex; FixPeriodicDegenerated must insert the implicit degenerate edge at pole/apex to heal the face; both faces wired into OPEN_SHELL */
